# Moving checklist (new flat, 1 Oct)

- [x] give notice to the landlord (30 days)
- [x] book the pickup truck and two helpers
- [ ] boxes: kitchen first, label every box with the room
- [ ] transfer the internet connection
- [ ] update address with the bank and university
- [ ] meter readings photos on both ends
- [ ] deep clean the old place for the deposit
- [ ] keys: collect 3 sets
